\sqrt{18} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $z$ lies in the second quadrant of the complex plane, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-1)| \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=3\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\theta =\\frac{3\\pi }{4}$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3\\pi \\text{i}/4}.\n$$" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384047 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384048 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384049 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384050 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186384051 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1041 "selection" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1104 #edb/ref 17592186384048 13194139536109 true] [17592186384046 1110 #uuid "741d8bc4-ef47-54c7-ab7d-7bb95d37c496" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384047 1034 "z=2\\sqrt{3}\\,{\\text{e}}^{-3\\pi \\text{i}/4}" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384047 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536109 true] [17592186384047 1111 #uuid "e6e31482-f332-5c48-b33b-ae038c3038ae" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384048 1034 "z=3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{3\\pi \\text{i}/4}" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384048 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536109 true] [17592186384048 1111 #uuid "0fd2a0f6-f5f9-5bf5-ad6c-a4c5431ce43d" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384049 1034 "z=3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{-3\\pi \\text{i}/4}" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384049 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536109 true] [17592186384049 1111 #uuid "2a0d3b65-b551-5e87-8dc6-aa2b512ddf8a" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384050 1034 "z=3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{-\\pi \\text{i}/4}" 13194139536109 true] [17592186384050 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536109 t